  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ed85aade91cb49029da4907012dc28e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  textComponent: {fileID: 1899238465}
  lines:
  - I love everything about games.
  - Game.
  - Play.
  - Fan service.
  - So naturally i wanted to become a game developer.
  - No..The best game developer
  - 'Like Hideo Kojima, Toby Fox and Yandere Dev. '
  - Everything is sunshine and rainbows.
  - I love people who make games.
  - 'Therefore everyone will love me once I become the best. '
  - Except for the fact you need other people.:(
  - What can they offer me???
  - "I have 670000 hours in unlimited engine, i am a powerhouse\Lthey will all chant
    my name!!"
  - (Zoe fell asleep press go button)
  textSpeed: 0.03
